    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kway win riwan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Macowe, wutmera, kway win riwan, ni mikwenda pa Rwoth womedere nyay mayot to limo dwoŋ, paka obedo i dier win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kway win bende ni Were wobothi wan kwoŋ joreco, rupiri k'obedo ni dhano je nigi yeyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Were genere, aka go bino miyo win meni to kuro win maber kwoŋ Ŋatarac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanitie gi geno kwoŋ win i Rwoth ni witimo gima waoro win, aka wibino medere gi timo ameno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi Rwoth womiy wibedi gi mar pa Were i cuny win kodi ciro teko paka Kristo ociro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Or ma tic",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nyingi Rwoth Yesu Kristo waoro win, wutmere; eye win kwoŋ jom'oyeyo je ma jotimo nyapo, ma jokimaki fonji ma wamiyo win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole wiwegi wiŋeyo maber ni wiripo luwo kwo ma wanyutho win. Wakibedo manyap munyo wanitie gi win, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka wakicamo cemo pa nyatoro ma wakiculo. Kucel, watiyo aka waol wor g'odieceŋ ŋey wakiri wakel peko ri nyatoro kwoŋ win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watimo ama ki rupiri wakiripi yenyo kwoŋ win kony; to watimo ameno ma miyo win ranen aluwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato munyo wanitie gi win wamiyo win cik ni, “Ŋata kimiti tic wokiri wocemi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawaco ama rupiri wawinjo nike nitie jomoro i dier win ma jonyap, ma jokitim gimoro je kwanyo woko riwirok i tic pa wadi gin ayino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nyingi Rwoth Yesu Kristo waoro, odoko wakwayo ji ma pameno jowoyiki kiti gin, aka jowocaki tic, ŋey jowolimi gima konyo kwo pajo wegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka riwin, jowot wan, wikiri wiol gi timo gim'otire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro nikenyo ma k'owinji mikwenda ma wadhiro riwin i balwa me, kaŋasa win go maber, aka wikiri witiyere gine, ŋey wiye wokwoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To wikiri witer go paka jakwor, kucel fonji win go paka omin win.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wac macowe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi Rwoth won, ma poko siem, womiy win siem hongo je kodi i royo je. Rwoth wobedi kodi dhano je kwoŋ win.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An Paulo, andiko moth me gi cingan won, aka meno a ranyuth m'aketho i balwin paran je. Me apaka andiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi nema pa Rwodhiwan Yesu Kristo wobedi gi wijoje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
